  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat percentage of Faraday's flower-shop sales came from sunflower bouquets? Faraday owns a flower stall. Faraday's flower shop sold 50 bouquets during the week. 12 of the bouquets sold that week were sunflower bouquets.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "LOSSY SELF-SUMMARY; VERIFY AGAINST NEW INPUTS\nVISIBLE PREFIX THROUGH TURN 5; LOSSY EXTRACT:\n- {\"content\":\"I should also tell you: Faraday sells individual sunflowers for $3 each.\",\"role\":\"user\"}\n- {\"content\":\"Got it—individual sunflowers cost **$3 each**. To calculate revenue from individual sunflowers, we would also need to know how many individual sunflowers Faraday sold.\",\"role\":\"assistant\"}\n- {\"content\":\"Good, now using that, can you calculate: How many sunflowers was Faraday able to sell after three days? And here are a few things you should know: Faraday sells bouquets of sunflowers for $8 each. Faraday earns $26 per day fr...\n- {\"content\":\"Over 3 days:\\n\\n**Individual sunflowers:**\\n\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\$26 \\\\times 3=\\\\$78\\n\\\\]\\n\\nAt \\\\$3 per sunflower:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\$78 \\\\div \\\\$3=26\\n\\\\]\\n\\nSo Faraday sold **26 individual sunflowers**.\\n\\n**Bouquets:**\\n\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\$56 \\\\times ...",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "One more thing — Each bouquet contains 12 sunflowers.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Faraday sold 12 sunflower bouquets out of 50 total bouquets.\n\n\\[\n\\frac{12}{50}\\times 100\\% = 24\\%\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{24\\%}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Faraday sells individual sunflowers for $2 each.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The price of individual sunflowers does not affect this calculation. Faraday sold 12 sunflower bouquets out of 50 total bouquets:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{12}{50}\\times 100\\% = 24\\%\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{24\\%}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
